              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NURSENIKKI2004"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was a total hit for Thanksgiving even with those who don't like sweet potato. I did double the recipe and add a cup of unsweetened coconut that I divided between the sweet potato and the topping. This will be a Thanksgiving and Christmas tradition from now on.",
